<title>USA: TENNIS-RESULTS AT MEMPHIS MEN'S TOURNAMENT.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-RESULTS AT MEMPHIS MEN'S TOURNAMENT.</headline>
<dateline>MEMPHIS 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results on Monday in the $825,000 St Jude men's tennis tournament (prefix number denote seeding)</p>
<p>First round</p>
<p>Patrick Rafter (Australia) beat Grant Stafford (South Africa) 6-4 6-3</p>
<p>Justin Gimelstob (U.S.) beat Jim Grabb (U.S.) 4-6 6-3 7-6 (7-4)</p>
<p>Magnus Norman (Sweden) beat Tomas Carbonell (Spain) 7-5 3-6 6-3</p>
<p>Brett Steven (New Zealand) beat Marcos Ondruska (South Africa) 6-3 6-4</p>
<p>Jacco Eltingh (Netherlands) beat Jan-Michael Gambill (U.S.) 6-3 6-3</p>
<p>Scott Draper (Australia) beat Luke Jensen (U.S.) 7-6 (7-3) 7-5</p>
<p>Bryan Shelton (U.S.) beat Steve Bryan (U.S.) 5-7 7-6 (7-4) 6-4</p>
<p>Gustavo Kuerten (Brazil) beat Byron Black (Zimbabwe) 6-2 6-7 (5-7) 7-6 (7-4)</p>
<p>Javier Frana (Argentina) beat Marcelo Filippini (Uruguay) 6-4 6-4</p>
</text>
